---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="pepprime | About" description="About pepprime peptide supplier.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:items-start">
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface/90 p-6 shadow-soft sm:p-8">
        <div class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-300" data-i18n="about.eyebrow">About pepprime</div>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white" data-i18n="about.title">A stronger peptide company presentation</h1>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-8 text-brand-muted sm:text-base">
          <p data-i18n="about.p1">
            pepprime is presented as a peptide-focused supplier for customers who want clear product information, visible pricing, and direct communication.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p2">
            The company profile combines product photography with a cleaner research-driven brand image to create a more professional customer experience across the website.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p3">
            The current catalog includes multiple peptide products across different strengths, supported by direct inquiry through WhatsApp or email.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-brand-border bg-white/5 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-white" data-i18n="about.card1Title">Fast response</div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-brand-muted" data-i18n="about.card1Copy">Quick communication for product and shipping inquiry.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-brand-border bg-white/5 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-white" data-i18n="about.card2Title">Professional image</div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-brand-muted" data-i18n="about.card2Copy">Cleaner biotech styling built around product clarity and stronger brand consistency.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-brand-border bg-white/5 p-5 shadow-soft sm:col-span-2">
          <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-white" data-i18n="about.card3Title">Homepage-first visual strategy</div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-brand-muted" data-i18n="about.card3Copy">Manufacturing, shipping, and laboratory imagery are focused on the homepage so internal pages stay cleaner and more professional.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
